project (k) (rows≈2 cost≈4.3K)
└─ join left_anti [sa.k = sb.k] (rows≈2 cost≈4.3K)
   ├─ source sa AS sa (rows≈3 cost≈12)
   └─ filter (== (call substr |sb.s| 2 1) (cast "x" <named StringView>)) (rows≈1 cost≈120)
      └─ source sb AS sb row-groups (== (call substr |sb.s| 2 1) (cast "x" <named StringView>)) (rows≈3 cost≈60)
